Hooks-rules violation: this `useEffect` is missing a dependency array, so it runs after *every* render instead of only when `close`/`refs` change. This trips `react-hooks/exhaustive-deps`, silently masks stale-ref bugs, and burns one commit per render. Provide an explicit dep list (and an inline eslint-disable with reason if intentional):

```ts
useEffect(() => {
  closeRef.current = close;
  refsRef.current = refs;
}, [close, refs]);
```

Also consider whether `useLayoutEffect` would be more appropriate here, since the ref-syncing must happen *before* the `[open]` effect attaches its listener in the same commit.

