actOnPending's useCallback lists showIoMsg in its deps, but showIoMsg is recreated on every render (no useCallback). This makes the memoization ineffective — actOnPending's identity changes every render and so do any memoized children that depend on it. Either wrap showIoMsg in useCallback (with [] deps since it only uses setIoMsg + a ref) or move it out as a stable function. While here, the inline async `onClick` on the "全部忽略" button returns a Promise React silently ignores; prefer `void (async () => { ... })()` or extract to a named handler consistent with the file's direct-binding style.

